@node Start here
@chapter Start here
@enumerate
@item
Run the tool's @code{check}. It changes nothing.
@item
If you are exposed, install the vendor's update. That is the permanent fix.
@item
If you cannot update yet, run @code{mitigate --dry-run} to see what the protection would do, then @code{mitigate}. @code{rollback} undoes it.
@item
If the flaw was being exploited, run @code{hunt}, then change any password, key or token an attacker could have reached.
@end enumerate
